<title>FRANCE: French industry chiefs say outlook improved.</title>
<headline>French industry chiefs say outlook improved.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following seasonally adjusted data.</p>
<p>A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>					Oct  Sep   Jul  Jun  May  Apr Mar</p>
<p> Recent past output	     -7     1    -9  -9   -12 -10   -8</p>
<p> Finished product stocks	 18   20    27  30   26   20   23</p>
<p> Overall orders and demand    -23  -25   -35 -37  -33  -32  -36</p>
<p> Foreign orders and demand    -16  -18   -25 -39  -31  -29  -30</p>
<p> Future output (overall)	-21  -29   -28 -27  -27  -23  -25</p>
<p> Future output (personal)	 5    5     3   2    1    9    0</p>
<p> Future prices (overall)	-30  -26   -22 -19  -16  -11  -15</p>
<p> Future prices (personal)     -13  -14    -9 -19   -9   -5   -7</p>
<p>Recent past output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	     8    8   -11  -7    5   -8   -1</p>
<p> Energy			     -63   22   -11  12  -68  -68   -5</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	    -2   -1    -8  -8  -10  -11   -9</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	    -12   -8   -15 -18  -21  -21  -24</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	-1   -6     0  -7  -17   -8   -7</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	 21   39   -23  20   23   -6   -5</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     1    8     6   3    1   -3   -2</p>
<p>Future output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	     1   -4   -26 -12   -7   -3   -3</p>
<p> Energy				55   -3    12  -7   72   68  -15</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     3    5     3   2   -2    3   -1</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods		4   -3    -2   0    0   -7   -6</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	 6    8     7   5   -7    4   -2</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-26   22     7   7   15   74   18</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     6    4    -3   2    6    6   12</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
